# Code Style & Done Checklist

## Code style

- Functional components + hooks only; no class components.
- Co-locate a component's styles/subcomponents in its own folder under `src/components/`.
- Keep components small and single-purpose; extract logic into `src/hooks/` when it grows past simple UI state.
- No inline styles except one-off dynamic values — use CSS files/modules.

## Before finishing any task

1. Run `npm run lint` and fix all issues.
2. Sanity-check responsiveness at ~375px, ~768px, and ~1280px.
3. If new dependencies were added, confirm they are in `package.json` (not only installed locally) and note why in the PR/commit message.
